part records
  tally 2
  note "The balances read from the record files whose rows no question reads one by one: the Wektor registers (units after each purchase), the Lazur export and Ania's savings export (balance after each row). Each is a reading of the place's balance (L §5.19) with the version anchoring it; the rows before it are not imported, so these places' balances before a reading are what is booked on them, and the readings restart them. The joint account's statements, the Brzask register and the Rzeka and DM Kopia registers are observations (statements/statements.tally)."

input abank: observed
  note "Rzeka Securities, client 4471-07, Anna Lis: the register's rows (rzk-4471-07-anna.csv)"

